OL,3,AHundreds of homes evacuated in Falmouth
OL,4,Aover unexploded WW2 bomb in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300 homes in Falmouth have
OL,7,Fbeen evacuated as experts deal with a
OL,8,FWorld War Two bomb
OL,10,FEmergency services were initially
OL,11,Fcalled to Falmouth Docks at 09:15 BST
OL,12,Fon Monday after the suspected 250lb
OL,13,F(115kg) American World War Two
OL,14,Fair-dropped device was found in the
OL,15,Fwater
OL,17,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone was
OL,18,Fpreviously in place which has since
OL,19,Fbeen expanded to 755m (2,477ft)
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
